# At or towards a position close in space or time. {{rfex|en}} <!-- despite other dictionaries giving examples such as "draw near", "come near", etc., I feel unhappy that "near" in these cases is truly adverbial. It seems more like an adjective complement. Note also that "stay near" is (at the time of writing) given above as an adjectival example. -->
