##: {{ux|en|a negotiable '''note'''}}
##* {{quote-song|en|year=1974|author={{w|Shirley Brown}}|title={{w|Woman to Woman (Shirley Brown song)|Woman to Woman}}|album=Woman to Woman|text=The car he drives / I pay the '''note''' every month}}
