#: {{ux|en|Your performance was fantastic! I have just one '''note''': you were a little flat in bars 35 and 36.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[notification|Notification]]; [[information]]; [[intelligence]].
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} Mark of [[disgrace]].
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Lucrece|passage=That my poſteritie ſham’d with the '''note''' / Shall curſe my bones, and hold it for no ſinne, / To wiſh that I their father had not beene.}}
