# {{lb|en|transitive}} To record in writing; to make a memorandum of.
#: {{ux|en|We '''noted''' his speech.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[denote]]; to [[designate]].
#: {{ux|en|The modular multiplicative inverse of ''x'' may be '''noted''' ''x''<sup>−1</sup>.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[annotate]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To set down in musical characters.
# {{lb|en|transitive|law}} To record on the back of (a bill, draft, etc.) a refusal of acceptance, as the ground of a protest, which is done officially by a [[notary]].
