===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|en|use}}
From {{inh|en|enm|note|t=use, usefulness, profit}}, from {{inh|en|ang|notu|t=use, enjoyment, advantage, profit, utility}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*notu}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*nutō|t=enjoyment, utilisation}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*newd-|t=to acquire, make use of}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|not||yield, produce, crop}}, {{cog|nl|genot||enjoyment, pleasure|sc=Latn}}, {{cog|nl|nut||usefulness, utility, behoof|sc=Latn}}, {{cog|de|Nutzen||benefit, usefulness, utility|sc=Latn}}, {{cog|is|not||use|pos=noun|sc=Latn}}. Related also to {{cog|ang|notian||to enjoy, make use of, employ}}, {{cog|ang|nēotan||to use, enjoy}}, {{cog|goh|niozan||to use, enjoy}} (Modern {{cog|de|genießen||to enjoy|sc=Latn}}), Modern {{cog|de|benutzen||to use|sc=Latn}}. Related to {{l|en|nait}}.

