#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2025-11-15|author=Cameron Pugh|titleurl=https://www.csmonitor.com/Business/2025/1115/boston-mbta-phillip-eng|journal=The Christian Science Monitor|title=To a T: How Phillip Eng got Boston’s subway system back on track|passage=Trust had reached a '''nadir.'''|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260517175714/https://www.csmonitor.com/Business/2025/1115/boston-mbta-phillip-eng|archivedate=17 May 2026}}
