* a variant of {{affix|en|mullet|t1=(''obsolete'') stone for grinding|-er}}; {{m|en||mullet}} is derived from {{der|en|fr|molette|t=pestle}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=† mullet|pos=''n.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=6867929750|date=July 2023}}</ref>

